WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:01.980
Yum!

00:02.220 --> 00:04.310
Tonkatsu curry is so good!

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Hey, Blade. You've got food on your face.

00:09.610 --> 00:11.180
I'll wipe it clean.

00:15.740 --> 00:16.870
Ah!

00:16.870 --> 00:18.960
What are you two doing?!

00:18.960 --> 00:20.410
<i>You</i> brought it up.

00:20.640 --> 00:22.000
Heya.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.040
Anna, mind if we join you?

00:24.340 --> 00:25.950
You're still calling me Anna?

00:26.450 --> 00:27.540
Not that I mind.

00:27.970 --> 00:29.730
Thanks, Anna.

00:31.020 --> 00:32.470
Hey, Blade.

00:32.470 --> 00:34.470
How do these outfits look on us?

00:34.970 --> 00:36.090
How, you ask?

00:36.480 --> 00:39.310
Oh, I suddenly feel so self-conscious.

00:39.820 --> 00:42.130
That's right. Today's the day, isn't it?

00:42.130 --> 00:44.480
Congratulations on moving up,
all four of you.

00:44.710 --> 00:45.630
Huh?

00:45.630 --> 00:47.730
You mean they're all in the advanced class?

00:47.730 --> 00:49.840
Didn't even notice, huh?

00:49.840 --> 00:52.100
That's why we're allowed to dress freely now.

00:52.100 --> 00:53.470
So how do we look?

00:53.470 --> 00:54.360
Any thoughts?

00:54.740 --> 00:55.860
I bet you're freezing.

00:57.370 --> 01:00.620
Why, how do you do, my fair ladies?

01:00.620 --> 01:04.370
Oh! I'm utterly entranced by your beauty!

01:04.590 --> 01:06.250
Um...

01:06.250 --> 01:07.150
Hey, Anna.

01:07.150 --> 01:09.090
Who's this gorgeous fella here?

01:09.360 --> 01:11.390
I'm quite flattered, really.

01:11.390 --> 01:15.130
Unfortunately, I love all 
women in equal measure.

01:15.670 --> 01:18.450
I cannot let myself be bound to just one.

01:16.410 --> 01:18.450
We get it, Leonard.

01:18.450 --> 01:21.100
Anyway, Blade, have you heard?

01:21.100 --> 01:22.120
Hmm?

01:22.120 --> 01:26.520
I hear His Majesty the King is having a 
magical beast brought here to the school.

01:27.140 --> 01:30.210
You mean we have to fight it for training?

01:30.210 --> 01:32.370
No way, that's way too extreme...

01:32.370 --> 01:33.570
Hmm...

01:34.000 --> 01:34.950
"Hmm," you say?!

01:34.950 --> 01:35.860
It's a magical beast!

01:35.860 --> 01:39.170
Well, I wouldn't put it past that old fart.

01:39.170 --> 01:41.560
"Old fart"?! That's lèse-majesté!

01:41.560 --> 01:43.280
Whatever, he deserves it.

01:45.180 --> 01:46.140
An earthquake?!

01:48.400 --> 01:49.460
Blade.

01:49.460 --> 01:51.020
Wait, could it be...

01:52.560 --> 01:53.750
Everyone!

01:55.180 --> 01:57.480
We should have everyone take shelter.

01:58.040 --> 01:59.260
Sheesh.

03:31.810 --> 03:34.980
<b>Episode 3</b>

03:32.560 --> 03:34.980
<b>Cu Chulainn</b>

03:38.870 --> 03:40.640
Someone call for His Majesty!

03:40.640 --> 03:43.680
He's the only one who can handle a dragon!

03:43.680 --> 03:44.370
Be careful!

03:44.370 --> 03:45.360
Take cover!

03:49.120 --> 03:50.550
This is the magical beast?

03:50.550 --> 03:51.290
What?

03:51.910 --> 03:53.280
A dragon?!

03:57.550 --> 03:58.300
Wait!

04:04.840 --> 04:06.140
Look out!

04:06.140 --> 04:08.360
You there, get back!

04:08.360 --> 04:09.370
Run for it!

04:18.060 --> 04:19.110
Sit!

04:23.310 --> 04:24.070
There.

04:24.370 --> 04:27.830
Blade, did you just subdue a 
dragon with your bare hands?

04:28.130 --> 04:30.760
Huh? This one's still young.

04:30.760 --> 04:33.090
You must have been scared, 
being dragged all the way here.

04:33.090 --> 04:34.830
Or are you hungry?

04:36.380 --> 04:37.100
Here.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.110
Too spicy for you?

04:42.110 --> 04:44.440
No way... Without any weapons?

04:42.910 --> 04:45.590
A dragon, with one blow?

04:44.440 --> 04:45.590
I can't believe it!

04:46.510 --> 04:49.400
No way, this is normal!

04:49.400 --> 04:51.490
It's normal, right?

04:55.480 --> 04:59.020
It's not like it's a Great Dragon,
or an Ancient Dragon!

04:59.020 --> 05:01.860
Anyone could take down this 
little dragon with a single hit!

05:03.670 --> 05:05.560
Um, well...

05:07.410 --> 05:08.070
Eh?!

05:08.620 --> 05:09.170
Huh?

05:09.170 --> 05:11.000
B-Behind you!

05:11.000 --> 05:12.120
Behind me?

05:13.540 --> 05:15.470
Parent!

05:15.470 --> 05:16.500
Whoa, what?!

05:16.950 --> 05:19.630
So you're my parent!

05:19.630 --> 05:20.450
Parent?

05:20.450 --> 05:22.120
Wait, what are you going on about?

05:21.250 --> 05:23.780
I've finally found you, Parent!

05:23.780 --> 05:25.380
So play with me!

05:25.380 --> 05:28.030
I'll go and find your parents later.

05:28.030 --> 05:29.200
There.

05:29.200 --> 05:32.140
Anyway, where did that dragon run off to?

05:32.140 --> 05:36.140
Th-Th-The dragon shrank 
down into that little girl!

05:33.510 --> 05:35.090
Play with me!

05:35.090 --> 05:38.010
Parent, play with me!

05:36.140 --> 05:39.400
Huh? That's impossible!

05:38.010 --> 05:40.260
Play with me!

05:39.400 --> 05:41.360
Hey, be quiet for a second!

05:41.360 --> 05:42.020
Aye.

05:42.020 --> 05:47.400
If you insist, I am more 
than willing to be quiet.

05:46.260 --> 05:47.400
Mm-hmm.

05:47.740 --> 05:49.480
So, where's the dragon?

05:49.480 --> 05:51.140
Like I said, that girl...

05:51.140 --> 05:52.600
Surely you joke.

05:52.600 --> 05:54.990
Blade. I saw it, too.

05:54.990 --> 05:56.910
Her true form is a dragon.

05:56.910 --> 05:57.790
What?!

05:57.790 --> 05:58.710
She's a dragon, for real?

05:58.710 --> 06:00.710
That's what I've been saying!

06:00.710 --> 06:02.840
Why do you believe Sophie and not me?!

06:02.840 --> 06:03.930
Parent.

06:03.930 --> 06:06.010
I did as you said and stayed quiet.

06:06.010 --> 06:08.610
A whole ten seconds, just for you.

06:08.610 --> 06:11.130
Now play with me!

06:10.120 --> 06:13.260
Wait, why are you calling me your parent?!

06:13.260 --> 06:16.160
That punch earlier was something else!

06:16.160 --> 06:18.510
I'd expect nothing less from my parent!

06:18.510 --> 06:20.290
Parent!

06:20.290 --> 06:23.360
Play with me! Play with me!

06:22.070 --> 06:23.900
Wh-What now?

06:23.360 --> 06:24.800
Play with me!

06:24.800 --> 06:27.400
Play with me! Play with me! Play with me!

06:31.410 --> 06:34.240
The roots of my horns are sensitive!

06:34.240 --> 06:36.050
Don't be rough with them!

06:36.050 --> 06:37.900
Sure, got it.

06:38.910 --> 06:40.790
How'd I end up doing this?

06:41.350 --> 06:42.350
That tickles!

06:42.350 --> 06:44.170
Hey, don't run away, Cu!

06:45.990 --> 06:47.170
Parent!

06:47.390 --> 06:51.680
What does the name you gave me, 
Cu Chulainn, mean?

06:51.940 --> 06:57.560
It's the name of a devoted knight, who was 
really strong and always kept promises.

06:57.560 --> 07:00.840
Aye. I can keep a promise.

07:00.840 --> 07:03.740
A dragon upholds an oath 
even if it costs them their life.

07:04.380 --> 07:05.440
Blade?

07:05.440 --> 07:07.370
Where are you, Blade?

07:08.280 --> 07:09.320
Y-You moron!

07:09.320 --> 07:11.950
If you were in the bath, 
you should have said so!

07:11.950 --> 07:14.380
Hey, you didn't give me any time to respond!

07:14.380 --> 07:16.220
So, did you learn anything?

07:16.220 --> 07:17.410
Oh, yeah.

07:18.080 --> 07:22.440
Magical beasts, including dragons, 
are creatures who seek out strength.

07:22.440 --> 07:24.540
When one is vanquished, its flesh may perish,

07:24.540 --> 07:29.550
but a fragment of its soul lingers 
as an agglomerate of knowledge.

07:29.550 --> 07:33.390
And when that soul becomes 
incarnated as another entity,

07:33.390 --> 07:36.810
it mimics the shape of the 
stronger being that finished it off.

07:37.270 --> 07:40.020
Perhaps it's an evolutionary 
instinct to seek out strength.

07:40.020 --> 07:44.810
So you mean a dragon defeated by a 
human can end up taking a human form?

07:44.810 --> 07:47.220
But it's an extremely rare occurrence.

07:47.220 --> 07:51.100
Not a lot of humans can take down 
a high-level beast like a dragon.

07:51.100 --> 07:53.760
Huh? Y-Yeah, you're right!

07:53.760 --> 07:57.080
You think Cu was vanquished 
by a human in her past life?

07:57.080 --> 07:59.990
Cu? That's her name?

07:59.990 --> 08:01.180
Did you give her that name, Blade?

08:01.180 --> 08:02.470
That's right!

08:02.470 --> 08:04.600
It's a name that pleases me greatly!

08:04.600 --> 08:05.500
What?!

08:05.910 --> 08:07.290
What's wrong, Earnest?

08:07.290 --> 08:10.260
You pervert!

08:10.810 --> 08:11.760
Unbelievable!

08:11.970 --> 08:13.280
Unbelievable!

08:13.280 --> 08:14.370
What was that for?

08:20.000 --> 08:22.760
Parent, I'm hungry!

08:22.760 --> 08:24.700
You can feed yourself, you know.

08:24.700 --> 08:25.280
Here.

08:29.370 --> 08:32.370
I'm perfectly capable of 
feeding myself, of course.

08:32.370 --> 08:36.780
However, being fed by Parent makes 
the food taste that much better!

08:39.280 --> 08:41.910
Um, do you mind if I also feed Cu?

08:42.210 --> 08:43.160
No!

08:44.400 --> 08:46.960
I won't be friends with weakling humans!

08:45.520 --> 08:46.960
There, there.

08:46.960 --> 08:49.140
Hey! Look at how scared Claire is.

08:49.140 --> 08:54.050
You're my parent now,
so you should only pay attention to me!

08:54.050 --> 08:57.960
In the morning, you need to 
give me good morning smooches,

08:57.960 --> 09:01.680
and for meals, you must let me 
sit in your lap and feed me!

09:01.680 --> 09:02.810
Ah. Yeah, yeah.

09:02.810 --> 09:03.850
You do that?!

09:04.160 --> 09:05.260
Do what?

09:05.260 --> 09:07.340
Morning... smooches...

09:07.340 --> 09:09.110
I haven't done that.

09:09.730 --> 09:14.120
Besides, you spend all your time 
staring at mature adult female bodies!

09:14.120 --> 09:16.240
I find that unacceptable!

09:16.240 --> 09:16.990
What?!

09:16.990 --> 09:19.410
Hey, don't go wandering off by—

09:18.190 --> 09:19.410
Wait, Blade!

09:19.410 --> 09:20.410
You were staring?

09:20.410 --> 09:21.690
At what, exactly?

09:21.690 --> 09:23.370
Sounds like he's guilty.

09:23.370 --> 09:25.210
What an awful thing to do!

09:25.210 --> 09:26.130
He's guilty, all right...

09:26.130 --> 09:26.710
Guilty!

09:26.710 --> 09:28.220
Not gentlemanly at all.

09:28.220 --> 09:30.570
I can only describe you as despicable.

09:30.570 --> 09:31.380
Well, then...

09:31.380 --> 09:34.920
By unanimous verdict,
we the jury find Blade guilty.

09:41.930 --> 09:44.070
Um, Earnest...

09:44.070 --> 09:47.560
Blade's looking at us 
like he wants to join in.

09:47.560 --> 09:49.690
And so what if he does?

09:49.690 --> 09:50.640
Oh, no...

09:50.640 --> 09:51.820
Never mind.

09:57.390 --> 09:58.970
Hey! Cu!

09:58.970 --> 10:00.380
Wanna join me?

10:06.810 --> 10:11.210
I don't need any training, 
but if you insist, Parent,

10:11.210 --> 10:14.590
I'm more than willing to show off my power.

10:14.990 --> 10:16.560
Yeah, yeah.

10:14.990 --> 10:16.560
Hey, Blade.

10:16.560 --> 10:18.800
We were told to group up with you.

10:18.800 --> 10:20.760
Show us the ropes for the advanced class.

10:20.760 --> 10:22.260
Oh, sure thing.

10:22.770 --> 10:26.170
Hey, I was hoping to specialize 
in espionage as a spy.

10:26.170 --> 10:27.700
Who should I have teach me?

10:27.700 --> 10:29.950
Sophie would be the one with those skills.

10:29.950 --> 10:31.520
Sophity!

10:32.050 --> 10:33.020
...Ty?

10:33.020 --> 10:34.650
Sophity!

10:34.650 --> 10:35.400
What?

10:35.680 --> 10:37.650
Then I guess it'll be us four.

10:37.650 --> 10:39.150
Oh, almost forgot.

10:40.480 --> 10:41.160
Huh?

10:41.160 --> 10:43.310
Where did Cu run off to?

10:43.310 --> 10:44.370
Cu?

10:44.370 --> 10:46.910
Man, she never listens to me.

10:48.640 --> 10:51.920
Nothing beats morning smooches!

11:06.380 --> 11:07.930
That girl's back again.

11:08.640 --> 11:10.710
If you're interested, wanna join in?

11:10.710 --> 11:11.690
We'd be happy to have you.

11:13.690 --> 11:15.440
Won't you be friends with us?

11:20.140 --> 11:22.720
You're no match for me at all.

11:27.430 --> 11:29.120
What were you up to, Cu?

11:31.720 --> 11:33.260
Nothing.

11:33.260 --> 11:34.870
Never mind that, Parent.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.590
My stomach is empty!

11:36.590 --> 11:38.210
I'm starving!

11:38.210 --> 11:40.220
Okay, tonkatsu curry it is!

11:40.220 --> 11:42.590
You know me too well!

11:42.590 --> 11:45.140
But don't make it spicy!

11:45.140 --> 11:48.350
Also, I absolutely refuse to eat carrots!

12:05.920 --> 12:07.510
Blade, are you in there?

12:09.800 --> 12:13.840
Dragons are tormented by their parents 
immediately after they're born.

12:13.840 --> 12:17.450
The child, learning that something 
stronger than it exists,

12:17.450 --> 12:19.460
imprints onto that thing as its parent.

12:19.460 --> 12:21.260
So that's why?

12:21.260 --> 12:25.120
Maybe she's been alone since she was born.

12:25.760 --> 12:28.390
You realize though, don't you?

12:29.020 --> 12:31.640
You can't keep pretending to be her parent.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.060
I know that.

12:34.060 --> 12:39.020
But if I'm not there as her parent, 
she'll end up truly alone in the world.

12:40.780 --> 12:43.770
You know how much it 
hurts to be alone, right?

12:43.770 --> 12:44.780
That's not fair!

12:44.780 --> 12:47.410
How am I supposed to argue 
anything after that?

12:48.270 --> 12:49.530
Sorry.

12:50.220 --> 12:51.450
It's fine.

12:51.450 --> 12:56.290
Now I know that you were serious when 
you decided to take care of her.

12:56.770 --> 12:58.880
That reassured you as well, right, Sophie?

12:59.350 --> 13:00.250
Sophie?!

13:04.220 --> 13:06.580
Wait, you didn't realize she was there?

13:06.580 --> 13:09.120
I ran into her on my way to your room.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.790
She's just like me.

13:10.790 --> 13:13.080
Looks like she was worried about you.

13:13.080 --> 13:17.150
Things are going well with Cu,
and there's nothing to worry about.

13:17.910 --> 13:18.830
I see.

13:21.850 --> 13:23.370
I'll be heading back, too.

13:23.370 --> 13:27.780
I wouldn't want rumors to spread about 
me sneaking off at night to see a boy.

13:34.670 --> 13:35.160
Huh?

13:43.500 --> 13:45.180
What's wrong, Cu?

13:51.000 --> 13:53.370
Looking at those calms me down.

13:53.970 --> 13:55.020
The moons, huh?

13:55.310 --> 13:59.270
The big one's the parent,
and the small one's the child.

13:59.270 --> 14:01.900
That's why they're always together.

14:01.900 --> 14:05.120
I would look up at them all the time 
when I was alone in the wasteland.

14:05.120 --> 14:06.240
Hey, Cu...

14:06.240 --> 14:09.120
Deep down, don't you want to make friends?

14:09.120 --> 14:12.410
Parent, you're gravely mistaken.

14:12.860 --> 14:17.830
Dragons are far sturdier than humans, 
both physically and mentally.

14:17.830 --> 14:19.190
We do not form flocks.

14:19.190 --> 14:21.670
We live alone, and we die alone.

14:21.670 --> 14:24.380
That's what it means to be a dragon.

14:24.380 --> 14:27.740
Therefore, I have no need for friends at all!

14:27.740 --> 14:31.000
Besides, the only one I need is you!

14:31.000 --> 14:32.680
You sure are strong, Cu.

14:32.680 --> 14:35.060
That hurts, Parent!

14:36.790 --> 14:40.950
I swear, you sure are hopeless.

14:44.320 --> 14:48.290
Do you realize exactly who I am?

14:51.440 --> 14:53.770
This isn't a day care center.

14:53.770 --> 14:54.910
Look, who else can I turn to?

14:55.230 --> 14:58.670
We're the only two people 
who can look after Cu.

14:58.670 --> 15:00.210
So, where's Cu?

15:00.210 --> 15:03.010
Oh, do I have a story for you.

15:05.080 --> 15:06.730
You're so adorable!

15:06.730 --> 15:08.160
Cuddle, cuddle.

15:10.240 --> 15:11.580
Cuddle, cuddle.

15:11.580 --> 15:13.000
Ow, that smarts!

15:12.000 --> 15:13.810
Your beard is so prickly!

15:13.810 --> 15:14.840
Is that an attack?

15:14.840 --> 15:17.060
Are you attacking me?!

15:17.060 --> 15:19.560
She burst out of the room, just like that.

15:19.560 --> 15:21.400
You can't even babysit?!

15:21.400 --> 15:22.270
So useless!

15:22.270 --> 15:23.280
Oh!

15:23.280 --> 15:26.350
Being reprimanded isn't half-bad!

15:26.350 --> 15:27.870
Scold me harder!

15:27.870 --> 15:29.570
This guy's a goner.

15:31.970 --> 15:33.400
Sheesh...

15:33.400 --> 15:35.580
Where in the world did Cu go?

15:41.040 --> 15:41.920
Come now!

15:41.920 --> 15:43.690
You mustn't bully that dragon whelp!

15:43.690 --> 15:45.590
Why, the poor thing!

15:45.590 --> 15:47.720
Agh! You've got the wrong idea, Blade!

15:47.720 --> 15:49.460
I wasn't bullying her!

15:49.460 --> 15:50.220
Glower!

15:51.160 --> 15:53.580
You fool! That won't work!

15:53.580 --> 15:56.480
What?! My eyebeam attack!

15:56.480 --> 15:58.860
<i>Are those dolls supposed 
to be me and Earnest?</i>

15:58.860 --> 16:00.800
Bullying is wrong! Always!

16:00.800 --> 16:02.800
Earnest, you're incorrigible!

16:02.800 --> 16:05.480
Oh, I'm so sorry!

16:05.480 --> 16:07.980
You fool! I won't accept your apology!

16:08.260 --> 16:09.860
<i>What awful slander.</i>

16:12.580 --> 16:13.590
Oh!

16:13.590 --> 16:16.850
Can you please be friends with my daughter?

16:16.850 --> 16:18.370
Roger. Totes can do.

16:18.370 --> 16:19.490
<i>Sophie?</i>

16:23.120 --> 16:25.300
Head pats for Cu!

16:25.300 --> 16:26.450
Not fair, Claire!

16:26.450 --> 16:28.130
I want to pat her head, too!

16:28.520 --> 16:29.860
<i>Claire and Yessica, huh?</i>

16:29.860 --> 16:33.260
Oh! I love all women in equal measure.

16:33.820 --> 16:35.610
<i>That's gotta be Leonard.</i>

16:35.610 --> 16:37.760
<i>That said, she sure is observant.</i>

16:44.830 --> 16:46.520
Hello, Altia.

16:46.820 --> 16:48.210
Good morning, Ilya.

16:48.210 --> 16:50.160
Makino, late again?

16:50.160 --> 16:52.070
Karima, good day to you.

16:52.070 --> 16:54.630
Marcia, Michael, Eddy.

16:54.630 --> 16:56.240
How have you all been?

16:56.240 --> 16:59.160
Curtis, Isabella, Marie, Alan.

16:59.160 --> 17:00.720
See you tomorrow.

17:00.720 --> 17:05.760
James, Sarah, Zuimos, Herrera, Olga, Irina!

17:01.540 --> 17:04.030
<i>I haven't heard these names before...</i>

17:04.030 --> 17:05.760
<i>Every student in the school?</i>

17:05.760 --> 17:06.540
<i>No way...</i>

17:06.540 --> 17:08.070
Oh!

17:08.070 --> 17:11.920
That makes 108 friends for my daughter!

17:22.930 --> 17:24.950
<i>I didn't even notice...</i>

17:30.190 --> 17:32.490
Oh, did you find Cu?

17:42.710 --> 17:44.080
Wh-What?!

17:49.830 --> 17:51.590
You idiot! Stop that!

17:51.590 --> 17:55.220
Hey! Cut it out, Blade!

17:56.160 --> 17:59.220
Tell me exactly what happened.

18:03.400 --> 18:06.400
What Cu needs are friends.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.980
Yes, I agree.

18:07.980 --> 18:11.110
But it's not possible because of her nature.

18:11.600 --> 18:15.920
Dragons can't acknowledge anyone 
weaker than them as an equal.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.550
It's not in their nature.

18:18.080 --> 18:20.120
For her to recognize someone as her friend,

18:20.460 --> 18:22.430
they need to defeat her.

18:23.370 --> 18:25.660
It doesn't mean anything if I beat her.

18:26.530 --> 18:27.870
I can't be her friend.

18:28.580 --> 18:31.380
There's nothing I can do...

18:31.380 --> 18:34.380
Nope. There's nothing you can do.

18:37.510 --> 18:39.610
In that case, turn to someone else!

18:39.610 --> 18:42.000
You can't fix it all by yourself!

18:42.000 --> 18:43.640
If so, then depend on others.

18:44.580 --> 18:47.890
I asked you for help not too long ago.

18:49.280 --> 18:50.630
It's unfair!

18:50.630 --> 18:53.590
I relied on you,
yet you won't do the same!

18:53.590 --> 18:55.280
What intolerable arrogance!

18:54.040 --> 18:55.280
Well, um...

18:55.280 --> 18:57.780
Just shut up and reach out for help!

18:58.010 --> 18:59.150
From me!

18:59.150 --> 19:00.940
From all of us!

19:11.670 --> 19:12.840
Wait, is that...

19:12.840 --> 19:14.340
The Empress?!

19:14.340 --> 19:15.750
The new kid's with her, too.

19:24.560 --> 19:26.800
I have a favor to ask all of you.

19:26.800 --> 19:28.470
You know Cu, don't you?

19:28.800 --> 19:32.600
I want you to fight Cu, 
a dragon, and beat her!

19:32.600 --> 19:34.680
Easier said than done...

19:34.680 --> 19:37.120
We can't go up against a dragon.

19:38.800 --> 19:39.530
I'm begging you!

19:40.000 --> 19:44.020
Please become friends with my daughter!

19:44.020 --> 19:46.040
I'm asking you as well.

19:46.040 --> 19:47.160
Please, fight alongside me.

19:47.160 --> 19:48.620
Empress?!

19:48.620 --> 19:50.290
Oh no, Lady Earnest!

19:54.890 --> 19:57.130
We're here to make the same request.

20:01.320 --> 20:02.380
Why?

20:02.740 --> 20:06.240
We're worried about Cu as well.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.500
Please, everyone.

20:07.500 --> 20:08.510
Do it for us.

20:08.780 --> 20:09.580
Please!

20:09.580 --> 20:10.890
We're on our knees here!

20:14.400 --> 20:16.360
O-Okay, we'll do it!

20:16.360 --> 20:18.150
Please stop kneeling!

20:18.420 --> 20:21.340
We'll do whatever you want!

20:43.450 --> 20:44.380
That's more like it!

20:44.750 --> 20:48.560
This is the kind of hands-on 
training I wanted to see!

20:48.560 --> 20:50.000
But you know, Gil,

20:50.000 --> 20:53.640
will a dragon even acknowledge defeat 
if it's taken down by such a large group?

20:53.640 --> 20:54.780
Why, sure.

20:54.780 --> 20:59.650
In the eyes of a dragon, humans are 
creatures that work collectively.

20:59.990 --> 21:04.150
Do you consider bees cowardly 
for fighting as a swarm?

21:04.150 --> 21:05.160
No.

21:05.160 --> 21:08.080
To a dragon, humans are the same.

21:08.080 --> 21:10.160
They wouldn't consider it playing dirty.

21:11.670 --> 21:15.900
That said, it's a shame I won't 
be able to watch him fight.

21:18.380 --> 21:21.710
I won't mind if you accidentally 
breathe fire on that old blowhard.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.470
Hey, Cu.

21:26.470 --> 21:28.220
I hear that when the humans captured you,

21:28.220 --> 21:31.430
they sprung a trap on you, so you 
couldn't fight to your heart's content.

21:31.890 --> 21:33.430
It must have been frustrating.

21:33.880 --> 21:36.120
This time, it'll be fair and square.

21:36.120 --> 21:38.360
Go on and see just how 
tough we humans can be.

21:38.950 --> 21:41.210
Show everyone what your strengths are!

21:54.160 --> 21:55.500
Everyone!

21:55.500 --> 21:56.790
Here we go!

21:56.790 --> 21:58.420
Yes, ma'am!

23:34.470 --> 23:39.930
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.300 --> 23:39.930
<b>The Rosewood Academy Training Exercise</b>
